# Acme AI Quickstart

This guide walks you through making your first request to Acme AI.

## 1. Create an API key

Create an API key from the Acme Developer Dashboard.

## 2. Install the SDK

```bash
npm install @acme/ai
```

## 3. Make a request

```text
import { AcmeAI } from "@acme/ai";

const client = new AcmeAI({
  apiKey: process.env.ACME_API_KEY
});

const response = await client.responses.create({
  model: "acme-1",
  input: "Explain APIs in one sentence."
});

console.log(response.output);
```

